            <note corresp="#d27-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d27-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Archives, Nixon Presidential Materials, NSC Files, Box 489,
                    President’s Trip Files, Dobrynin/Kissinger, 1970, Part 2, Vol. I. Top Secret;
