                    For the full text of the memorandum, see <ref target="frus1969-76v12#d168">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, volume XII,
                        Soviet Union, January 1969–October 1970, Document 168</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d27-f2" n="2" xml:id="d27-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d26">Document 26</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d27-f3" n="3" xml:id="d27-f3-content">
                <p>The paper consisted of the text of the guidelines printed in full in <ref
                        target="#d28">Document 28</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
